    "description": {
      "value": "A slavering maw opens beneath a target and tries to take a bite out of them. Make a spell attack roll. On a hit, the mouth deals 2d6 piercing damage, and you gain 1d4 temporary Hit Points that last until the beginning of your next turn."
    },
